request.description:
The slug cannot change. `whatsapp` must be a 10-digit Indian mobile number, optionally starting with 91. The body is the copy taken by *List businesses*, so running it changes nothing. Example:

```json
{
  "name": "Sreebhavanam",
  "logo_url": null,
  "about": "Event hall and rooms.",
  "whatsapp": "9847000002",
  "phone": "04712345678",
  "timings": [
    {
      "label": "Front desk",
      "hours": "Open 24 hours"
    }
  ]
}
```

